osAfrica Wallpaper Assets
=========================

Place wallpaper images here:
- osafrica-dark.png     — Default dark wallpaper (3840x2160)
- osafrica-light.png    — Light variant
- osafrica-minimal.png  — Minimal/logo-only variant

Design guidelines:
- Primary color: #00cc66 (osAfrica green)
- Background: #0a0a0a (near-black)
- Subtle geometric patterns or circuit-board motifs
- Africa continent silhouette integrated with AI neural network imagery
- Clean, modern, minimal

Generate with: any image tool, Inkscape SVG → PNG export, or AI image generation
Target resolution: 3840x2160 (4K), auto-scales down
